     "description": "In the final moments of a tense, goalless Game 6, it was Pius Suter who sealed the series for Vancouver. With less than two minutes remaining in the third period, the puck was sent around the boards to Brock Boeser behind the net. Sensing the opportunity, Suter dashed towards the net. Boeser executed a quick turnaround pass, connecting perfectly with Suter, who wasted no time burying the puck into the back of the net. This lone goal propelled Vancouver into the second round of the Stanley Cup Playoffs.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
